   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to icddr,b Bangladesh, Centrum for Diarrhoeal Research based in Dhaka. It is a continuation of earlier support.     Duration is 2012-2014 with total 30 MSEK/distr annually with 10 MSEK. The responsibility for the contr lies at Emb/Dhaka in overall coop    with PARTNER/FORSK who is resp for addit research support via Regional Asia/resp Sida HQ, 6 million SEK/year 2012-2015, MSEK 24</narrative>
